# Unicode CLDR, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/ha/dateFields.json.
# week displayName mako, plural makonni.  sati is CLDR's own second word for
# a week -- it is what relative-type--1 ("satin da ya gabata") and
# relativePeriod ("sati na {0}") are built on -- and en.wiktionary.org gives
# the two as synonyms.  satin is the definite form CLDR itself writes in
# "satin da ya gabata" and "wannan satin".
mako
makonni
sati
satin
